.     * ── Classify each group's outcome into three mutually exclusive types ──
.     * group_outcome values:
.     *   mutual_12, mutual_23, mutual_31  → coalition
.     *   no_dwl_star_1/2/3               → slacker star (Slacker treatment onl
> y)
